{"parse": {"title": "尘埃与星的边界-04", "pageid": 89651, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%98%E5%9F%83%E4%B8%8E%E6%98%9F%E7%9A%84%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C-03\" title=\"尘埃与星的边界-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">尘埃与星的边界-04</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%98%E5%9F%83%E4%B8%8E%E6%98%9F%E7%9A%84%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C-05\" title=\"尘埃与星的边界-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">尘埃与星的边界</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">04</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.97.AE.E7.AD.94.E7.9A.84.E8.89.BA.E6.9C.AF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"问答的艺术\">问答的艺术</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 问答的艺术</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Art of Defense</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>序幕</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>教授杰定</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"3\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>教授查特吉</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"4\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>教授拉杰夫</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"5\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>落幕</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-daxuekeshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"daxuekeshi\"><img alt=\"daxuekeshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/600px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/900px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/1200px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那 ：</div><div>根据数据，白矮星FYDL 82A与伴星之间的间距正在以缓慢的速度缩小。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那 ：</div><div>它们像两颗旋转着同时落入球洞的玻璃球。不同的是，届时它们不会彼此碰撞、分离……<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那 ：</div><div>白矮星将吸收伴星的物质，两者相互交合，产生热核反应。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那 ：</div><div>最终，将会发生有史以来，距离地球最近的超新星爆炸……<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>会谈所的教授鸦雀无声，他们需要足够的时间吸收这始料未及的信息。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那 ：</div><div>根据现有的数据，我们还无法推测此次超新星爆炸对地球运行轨道的作用。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那 ：</div><div>但爆炸所产生的射线……可能对地球上的生物具有——毁灭性的影响。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>你放下研究报告，沉默的会谈所令你感到不安。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们是否认可了自己的报告？还是觉得这份报告荒谬至极，以至于无从提问？<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>亦或者，他们只是被这个危险的结论震惊得无话可说？<br /></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教授杰定 ：</div><div>你的研究结论令我们非常震惊，我想你有所预见。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那 ：</div><div>是的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教授杰定 ：</div><div>你考虑过发布这篇报告后，可能引起的民众恐慌吗？如果你的推测错误，研究所将成为舆论的众矢之的。<br /></div></div><div class=\"tabber\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first style-choice\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 6px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"storyselect\" data-storyselect=\"1\">这不是研究员需要顾及的</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"storyselect\" data-storyselect=\"2\">质疑与恐惧是追寻真理的必经之路</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"storyselect\" data-storyselect=\"3\"></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-storyselect=\"1\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那 ：</div><div>我只是察觉并推测存在的可能性，揭露这个可能性是研究员的义务。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那 ：</div><div>而这个可能性是否会引起公众的恐慌，并不在我的考量范围内。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那 ：</div><div>我只负责保证我的研究报告符合《科研诚信协议》。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他摩挲着胡子，紧锁眉头。<br /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-storyselect=\"2\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那 ：</div><div>天气预报并不会因预报暴风雨，而受到谴责。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那 ：</div><div>质疑、恐慌……没有任何一项研究能独善其身，躲开这些。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那 ：</div><div>我愿意为后续的舆论承担责任，这是我应当付出的代价。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他叹了口气，却仍旧点了点头。<br /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-storyselect=\"3\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"3\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教授查特吉 ：</div><div>我对你的结论没有异议，你的数据足够完善严谨……<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教授查特吉 ：</div><div>但我好奇的是，你是否研究过防范这种射线的方法？还是说你选择置之不顾。<br /></div></div><div class=\"tabber\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first style-choice\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 6px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"storyselect\" data-storyselect=\"1\">我只负责提出问题</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"storyselect\" data-storyselect=\"2\">我们别无他法</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"storyselect\" data-storyselect=\"3\"></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-storyselect=\"1\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那 ：</div><div>现阶段我们仅能到这一步，至于对该射线的研究分析，暂且还未列上日程。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那 ：</div><div>但如果这个报告通过，我想我可以申请到更多的科研经费进行这项研究。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那 ：</div><div>当然，这同时也是一种赌约……推测与事实并非没有距离。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那 ：</div><div>我无法保证这项“投资”的收益。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他松一口气，这些回答令他释怀。<br />至少他知道你是有所考虑，而非把这个问题抛掷脑后。</div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-storyselect=\"2\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那 ：</div><div>现阶段的研究无法分析该射线的成分，我无法给出解决方案。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那 ：</div><div>这很悲观，但事实如此。我想我们只能把希望寄托于进一步的研究。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教授查特吉 ：</div><div>……看来在弄清它之前，我有一段时间的噩梦可做了。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他摇了摇头，摘下眼镜，揉捏着鼻梁。<br /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-storyselect=\"3\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"4\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教授拉杰夫 ：</div><div>我倾向把这看作是一份带着末日论调的报告。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教授拉杰夫 ：</div><div>不得不承认，这份报告带着很深的神秘学的影子。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教授拉杰夫 ：</div><div>我应该如何信任一位神秘学家？我有理由猜测，你试图通过这份报告引起舆论关注，借此让神秘学家崭露头角——像某种宗教。<br /></div></div><div class=\"tabber\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first style-choice\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 6px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"storyselect\" data-storyselect=\"1\">这是一种偏见</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"storyselect\" data-storyselect=\"2\">数据是客观的</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"storyselect\" data-storyselect=\"3\"></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-storyselect=\"1\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那 ：</div><div>末日论……这很荒谬。如果事实如您所说，我现在应该是一位煽动民众的政治家。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那 ：</div><div>而政治家不需要在您面前进行严谨的证明。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教授拉杰夫 ：</div><div>谁又能保证你不是呢？<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他耐人寻味地看着你，你明白已于事无补。<br /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-storyselect=\"2\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那 ：</div><div>星体的运行并不以我的意志为变化。是资料所列出的观测、对照数据，给出了可能性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那 ：</div><div>在您看来，神秘学家也许谎话连篇，但数据材料，它比任何东西都诚实。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教授拉杰夫 ：</div><div>很聪明的回答……<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教授拉杰夫 ：</div><div>但你是不是一个狡猾的神秘学家，我们拭目以待。<br /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-storyselect=\"3\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"5\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-daxuekeshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"daxuekeshi\"><img alt=\"daxuekeshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/600px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/900px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/1200px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>长舒一口气，你熬过了质询会，门口的怪物已失去踪影。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>起码这下，你不用担心再像一头待宰的羔羊被拖进研究所了。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>抛开敌意与质疑，教授们再次向你提出了若干建议，这次是以更加温和的方式。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>显而易见，这些建议比质询更有用处，你需要花更多的时间来缝缝补补了……<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-307001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伽菈波那：</div><div>呼……<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>此时，你显然还没有发觉，头顶上悬挂着一颗漆黑的星体……<br /></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "尘埃与星的边界-04"}}